d image ${index + 1}: $imageUrl - ${e.message}\",\n e\n )\n }\n }\n }\n\n withContext(Dispatchers.Main) {\n android.util.Log.d(\"MainActivity\", \"Image download completed: $successCount/${imageUrls.size} successful\")\n if (successCount > 0) {\n // ダウンロード完了後にウィジェットを更新\n android.util.Log.d(\"MainActivity\", \"Updating widget with $successCount images\")\n notifyWidgetUpdate()\n } else {\n android.util.Log.w(\"MainActivity\", \"No images downloaded successfully\")\n }\n }\n }\n } catch (e: Exception) {\n withContext(Dispatchers.Main) {\n android.util.Log.e(\"MainActivity\", \"Error in download process\", e)\n }\n }\n }\n }"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","name":"edit_file","tool_call_id":"toolu_bdrk_01SLcXkxQYgLmBGjwJkYtsG4","content":"The apply model made the following changes to the file:

